      "title": "Air India sacks pilot who tested positive for psychoactive substance after Phuket-Delhi flight scare",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/air-india-sacks-pilot-who-tested-positive-for-psychoactive-substance-after-phuket-delhi-flight-scare/article71428735.ece",
      "description": "The development comes after the AAIB report flagged it as a “serious concern” and recommended that the DGCA take appropriate action on priority",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
